v>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20251104203736&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Repair_Kit_For_Boats_2c843c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  repair kit for boats.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 15.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">A practical repair kit for small boats, complete with tar and all the necessary tools.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Can be used on the small boat south-west in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20Ada\">Isle of Ada</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33831,32232,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33831, 32232, 7)</a>, for a chance to get teleported to the small boat north of the isle, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33901,32106,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33901, 32106, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>It is not guaranteed to succeed, and might require a few tries. The item does not disappear when used.\n</p>\n<ul><li>when failing: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You were not able to fix the boat with the repair kit and the few spare parts it came with.</span></li>\n<li>when suceeding: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You manage to repair the boat using the kit. The small boat is sturdy enough to sail around the reef and towards a tiny bay at the back of the isle.</span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Clavius\">Clavius</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Adlerauge\">Adlerauge</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Clavius\">Clavius</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Michael%20the%20Stalwart\">Michael the Stalwart</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Overseer%20Osverger\">Overseer Osverger</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Raubritter\">Raubritter</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-order-of-the-stag-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-order-of-the-stag-quest","quest":"The Order of the Stag Quest","step":"2-9","n":17,"title":"Atalho para as próximas visitas (opcional)","kind":"needed","coords":[{"x":33831,"y":32232,"z":7,"label":"Pequeno barco a sudoeste (usa aqui o Repair Kit For Boats)"},{"x":33901,"y":32106,"z":7,"label":"Pequeno barco a norte da ilha (chegada)"}]},{"slug":"the-order-of-the-stag-quest","quest":"The Order of the Stag Quest","step":"5-9","n":35,"title":"Sair da sala do boss","kind":"needed","coords":[]}],"drops":[{"creature":"Clavius","pct":24.447,"qty":"1","rarity":"comum","hp":"40,000","exp":"75,000","loc":"Isle of Ada , here","spots":[{"x":33862,"y":32106,"z":4,"text":"Isle of Ada , here"}],"href":"#/wiki/Clavius"}],"spots":[{"x":33831,"y":32232,"z":7,"text":"Can be used on the small boat south-